title: The Dawn of APRA
new-page: true

= THE DAWN OF APRA
= Peru, 1985–1992

A political strategy game about the APRA government, economic crisis, party politics, insurgency and the survival of Peruvian democracy.

You will guide the government from Alan García's inauguration through a decade of escalating political and economic pressure.

Every decision can change the course of the campaign.

- @start: Begin the campaign

